Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: TopDepth (atomized module)

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: TopDepth
        Params: stack
        Returns: d
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: stack
            Returns: L
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Sub
            Params: L, 1
            Returns: last
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.ListGet
            Params: stack, last
            Returns: frame
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: frame, "depth"
            Returns: d
        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            State: Ok
            Returns: d
